# SmartExchange frontend

Location: `frontend/src/`.

## Conventions

- Vue 3 + Vite 6, Pinia stores, Vue Router, vue-i18n, Tailwind.
- API calls go through services under `src/services/` — base URL `/api` (Vite dev proxy to Django `:8000`).
- Site branding/contact fields come from `SiteSettings` via the Pinia store — avoid hardcoding phones, addresses, or URLs.
- Production build outputs to `backend/static/vue/`; Django serves the SPA via catch-all `SPAView`.

## Verify

```bash
cd frontend && npm run build
```
